  "description": "Unable to fully transform into a human, Laria, the white fox beastman who was considered a failure among the fox tribe, finally succeeded in transforming into the form of a little fox with fluffy white ears.\n\nHowever, her joy was short-lived as she became troubled when she couldn’t revert to her human form. At that moment, she was abducted by Zenox, the black wolf beastman.\n\nAfter managing to escape, three years later, Laria is forced by the crown prince’s order to attend an arranged marriage meeting with someone whose name she doesn’t even know. Reluctantly, she goes to the meeting, only to find herself face-to-face with none other than Zenox Claseum—the very same one who had once kidnapped her!\n\n(Source: AmazonJP, translated)",
